
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Skaag Empire.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Skaag Empire.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"sxli1a","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777016017211,"size":2014,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"sxli1a"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,30],"#Nations - The Skaag Empire":[32,33],"#A powerful and aggressive expansionist empire from across the ocean.":[34,39],"#A powerful and aggressive expansionist empire from across the ocean.#{1}":[35,39]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":120,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["skaag","skaagi","empire","invaders","pradesh"],"refine_keys":["naval","invasion","fleet","occupied","raiders","slavers","empire"],"position":"after","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What this is:** The Skaag Empire is a powerful, expansionist nation across the ocean, ideologically driven by a pantheon of brutal war gods. They are Flora's primary existential threat, though currently distracted by wars on their home continent.\n\n**When to select:** Mentioning external threats to Flora, piracy/raiding events, naval conflicts, or the political/military balance of power in the region. Also relevant for characters discussing foreign invasion fears, slavers, or religious extremism opposite Althena's teachings.\n\n**Key relationships:** Exist in perpetual undeclared war with Flora (especially Florans, whom they see as soft/enslavable). Conquered the Pradeshi island chain a generation ago, using it as a staging ground for southern coast raids. Limited full-scale invasion capacity only due to ongoing home continent wars."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Skaag Empire.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"ijg3l7","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/nations/Nations - The Skaag Empire.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,30],"size":1123,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
